 "custom_stages": {
  "about": "Stages RiskOfCraft makes from a RoR2 stage's layout (its collision, navigation, director and teleporter) dressed as a Minecraft dimension: terrain retextured with the player's own Minecraft block textures, fog, Minecraft decorations and extra loot. self_light: how strongly the Minecraft texture lights itself (0 none, 1 full), as Minecraft draws blocks readable in a dark dimension. light_rgb: colour of the stage's added sky light (a directional light at self_light x 2 intensity), so the Minecraft blocks read like a lit dimension. fog_strength: multiplies the base stage's fog density (RoR2 RampFog intensity), 1 keeps it.",
  "columns": [
   "id",
   "base_scene",
   "title",
   "subtitle",
   "top_texture",
   "side_texture",
